              </div>

              <h1 className="mt-5 max-w-3xl font-serif text-3xl leading-tight text-[#233b35] dark:text-[#f5f1ea] sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
                {studio.title}
              </h1>

              <p className="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#66736d] dark:text-[#b3beb8]">
                A creative space designed to help you bring your next idea to
